  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/banner/caverns_and_chasms.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fblueprint\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"蓝图\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/blueprint\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"网站\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/website\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"X\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/x\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fpatreon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/patreon\"></a>\n</p><h3>📖 关于：</h3><p>洞穴与深渊（Caverns &amp; Chasms）为 Minecraft 地表下的地下世界带来了全新的体验。在岩石中散布着新的矿石，例如锡、银和尖晶石，它们可能出现在岩土附近，或由破碎的脆弱岩石显露出来！你可以发现大量新生物，包括新的敌对生物，如潜伏者、窥探者和模仿者，以及其他生物如怒视者和铜傀儡！此外，还引入了许多新的方块系列，包括圆石、紫水晶和青金石建筑方块，以及全新的杜鹃木系列！本模组还包含许多小型特性，文档正在编写中，但在此期间，如需更多信息，请查看我们 Discord 中的展示频道以及我们网站上的博客文章！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fblueprint\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/blueprint.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fabnormals_delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/abnormals_delight.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fallurement\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/allurement.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fatmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/atmospheric.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fautumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/autumnity.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fberry_good\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/berry_good.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fboatload\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/boatload.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fbuzzier_bees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/buzzier_bees.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fcaverns_and_chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/caverns_and_chasms.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fclayworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/clayworks.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fendergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/endergetic.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fenvironmental\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/environmental.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fgallery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/gallery.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fincubation\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/incubation.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fneapolitan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/neapolitan.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fpersonality\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/personality.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fpet_cemetery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/pet_cemetery.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fsavage_and_ravage\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/savage_and_ravage.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fupgrade_aquatic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/upgrade_aquatic.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fwoodworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/woodworks.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n</p><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fnodecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/nodecraft.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
